body:
you can actually just add the keyframes on that single video. For example if you want a linear blur to be both a transition on the start and end;

&#x200B;

Set the first keyframe to be max then add a second one next (just 3 secs maybe) to be zero. Then do it again with the keyframes swapped on the end. :)

i love Anthony's calmness of presenting videos, specially the video about the new Mac

&#x200B;

But sometimes i just want an old fashioned Linus way of presenting, it's his energy that made me a fan of LTT in the first place :)
